<%- include('partials/header') %>

<!-- Refund & Cancellation Policy -->
<section class="pt-32 pb-16 bg-orange-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
        <h1 class="header-title text-4xl text-center text-gray-800 mb-6">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
        <div class="prose max-w-3xl mx-auto text-gray-700">

            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB') %></p>

            <p>This Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy outlines the terms under which customers may cancel an order, request a return, or obtain a refund for products purchased through the BagVati Platform.</p>

            <h3>1. Order Cancellation</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Orders may be cancelled <strong>before they are shipped</strong>. Once an order has been dispatched, cancellation may not be possible.</li>
                <li>If the order is already out for delivery, you may refuse delivery at the doorstep. Once returned to us, we will process the refund as applicable.</li>
                <li>BagVati reserves the right to cancel any order due to unforeseen circumstances such as stock unavailability, payment issues, or suspicious/fraudulent activity.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>2. Return Eligibility</h3>
            <p>You may request a return under the following conditions:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Product received is damaged, defective, or not as described.</li>
                <li>Product received in wrong size, wrong model, or incorrect quantity.</li>
                <li>Return request must be submitted within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong> along with photo/video proof.</li>
                <li>Products must be unused, in original packaging, and with all tags intact.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>3. Items Not Eligible for Return</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Products damaged due to misuse, mishandling, or improper usage.</li>
                <li>Items returned without original packaging or missing accessories.</li>
                <li>Products marked as <strong>Final Sale</strong> or <strong>Non-returnable</strong> on the product page.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>4. Reporting Damaged or Defective Products</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Customers must report issues within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong>.</li>
                <li>Photo/video evidence of the issue is required for verification.</li>
                <li>Upon verification, BagVati will offer a replacement or refund based on the policy and product availability.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>5. Refund Process</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Refunds are issued only after the returned product passes quality inspection at our facility.</li>
                <li>Once approved, refunds will be initiated to the original payment method used during purchase.</li>
                <li>Refunds typically take <strong>5–7 working days</strong> to reflect in your bank/wallet account, depending on the payment gateway and issuing bank.</li>
                <li>For prepaid orders where the payment failed but was debited, refunds are processed automatically by the payment provider within 5–7 business days.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>6. Replacement Policy</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Replacements are subject to stock availability.</li>
                <li>If a replacement is not available, a full refund will be issued.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>7. Manufacturer Warranty</h3>
            <p>If the product includes a manufacturer warranty, customers must contact the manufacturer directly for warranty claims. BagVati may assist in providing relevant invoice details if required.</p>

            <h3>8. Non-Refundable Conditions</h3>
            <ul>
                <li>Returns initiated after the allowed window.</li>
                <li>Intentional damage, incorrect usage, or mishandling of the product.</li>
                <li>Products used or tampered with after delivery.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>9. Contact &amp; Support</h3>
            <p>For assistance with cancellations, returns, replacements, or refunds, please contact our customer support team:</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
                Email: <a href="mailto:support@bagvati.works" class="text-blue-600 underline">support@bagvati.works</a><br>
                Business Hours: Monday - Friday (09:00 AM - 06:00 PM)
            </p>

            <p>BagVati reserves the right to modify this Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy at any time. Updated terms will be posted on this page.</p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
